osegarden every morning from 8 am till 9 am\"},\n    {\"text\": \"She visited the rosegarden right after her breakfast.\", \"line\": 7, \"span\": \"right after her breakfast\"},\n    {\"text\": \"From 02:00 till 15:30 o'clock, she worked in the rosegarden to tidy it up.\", \"line\": 8, \"span\": \"From 02:00 till 15:30 o'clock, she worked in the rosegarden to tidy it up\"},\n    {\"text\": \"Her mother did not appreciate that she, as a princess, would actually work in the garden.\", \"line\": 8, \"span\": \"Her mother did not appreciate that she, as a princess, would actually work in the garden\"},\n    {\"text\": \"The princess didn't care that her mother did not appreciate her working in the garden.\", \"line\": 8, \"span\": \"but the princess didn't care\"},\n    {\"text\": \"The rosegarden lost all his life in winter.\", \"line\": 12, \"span\": \"The rosegarden lost all his life in winter\"},\n    {\"text\": \"The young lady could not enjoy the colors and the life the rosegarden harbored in winter.\", \"line\": 12, \"span\": \"so the young lady could not enjoy the beautiful colors and all the life the rosegarden harbored\"},\n    {\"text\": \"Once spring arrived, the rosegarden turned back to life and color.\", \"line\": 13, \"span\": \"But once spring arrived, it turned back to life and color\"},\n    {\"text\": \"The rose garden was the private property of the royal family.\", \"line\": 17, \"span\": \"the rose garden was the private property of the royal family\"},\n    {\"text\": \"The young princess insisted on making the garden accessible to the public every March 1st to March 31st.\", \"line\": 17, \"span\": \"the young princess insisted on making the garden accessible to the public every March 1st to March 31st\"},\n    {\"text\": \"During that time, people from all over the country traveled to the castel to enjoy a day wandering through the rosegarden.\", \"line\": 18, \"span\": \"During that time, people from all over the country traveled to the castel to enjoy a nice day wandering through the rosegarden just like their beloved princess\"},\n    {\"text\": \"It became tradition that everyone who visited the rosegarden from the outside picked their favorite scenery and tried to draw what they liked most.\", \"line\": 22, \"span\": \"It became tradition that everyone who visited the rosegarden from the outside picked their favorite scenery and tried to draw what they liked most\"},\n    {\"text\": \"They then sent the postcard to their home.\", \"line\": 22, \"span\": \"They then sent the postcard to their home\"},\n    {\"text\": \"People were starting to make bets on whether the postcard arrived at their home before they arrived home.\", \"line\": 23, \"span\": \"People were starting to make bets on whether the postcard arrived at their home before they arrived home\"},\n    {\"text\": \"In many cases, it was a tie because the people and the postcards were usually transported in the same carriage.\", \"line\": 24, \"span\": \"In many cases, it was a tie because the people and the postcards were usually transported in the same carriage\"},\n    {\"text\": \"There was an old lady that lived in a dark, spooky forest.\", \"line\": 28, \"span\": \"there was an old lady that lived in a dark, spooky forest\"},\n    {\"text\": \"The forest was not traversable between October and April.\", \"line\": 32, \"span\": \"The forest was not traversable between October and April\"},\n    {\"text\": \"The forest was too wet and too cold between October and April.\", \"line\": 32, \"span\": \"as it was too wet and too cold\"},\n    {\"text\": \"The old lady nevertheless lived the entire year in the forest.\", \"line\": 33, \"span\": \"The old lady nevertheless lived the entire year in the forest\"},\n    {\"text\": \"Over the years, she acclimated to the weather.\", \"line\": 33, \"span\": \"Over the years, she acclimated to the weather and built strategies to survive the harsh conditions\"},\n    {\"text\": \"Over the years, she built strategies to survive the harsh conditions.\", \"line\": 33, \"span\": \"Over the years, she acclimated to the weather and built strategies to survive the harsh conditions\"},\n    {\"text\": \"Many people suspected the old lady would be a witch that worked on forbidden magic.\", \"line\": 37, \"span\": \"many people suspected the old lady would be a witch that worked on forbidden magic\"},\n    {\"text\": \"Instead of harvesting skulls and bones, she collected wild herbs.\", \"line\": 37, \"span\": \"Instead of harvesting skulls and bones, she collected wild herbs\"},\n    {\"text\": \"Those wild herbs were tried and sold to wandering travelers.\", \"line\": 38, \"span\": \"Those wild herbs were tried and sold to wandering travelers who transported and sold the herbs into the cities\"},\n    {\"text\": \"Wandering travelers transported and sold the herbs into the cities.\", \"line\": 38, \"span\": \"who transported and sold the herbs into the cities\"},\n    {\"text\": \"In one harsh winter, many people of the nearby village became very sick.\", \"line\": 42, \"span\": \"In one harsh winter, many people of the nearby village became very sick\"},\n    {\"text\": \"One young man took the courage and traveled to the old lady's house deep in the woods in a desperate attempt to help the villagers.\", \"line\": 42, \"span\": \"In a desperate attempt to help the villagers, one young man took the courage and traveled to the old lady's house deep in the woods\"},\n    {\"text\": \"It took him days to reach her house as he struggled with the wet and slippery ground.\", \"line\": 43, \"span\": \"It took him days to reach her house as he struggled with the wet and slippery ground\"},\n    {\"text\": \"He lost his orientation several times.\", \"line\": 43, \"span\": \"He also lost his orientation several times\"},\n    {\"text\": \"He eventually reached her house.\", \"line\": 44, \"span\": \"But eventually, he reached her house\"},\n    {\"text\": \"He carefully knocked and hoped that all the rumors about the lady were untrue.\", \"line\": 44, \"span\": \"He carefully knocked and hoped that all the rumors about the lady were untrue\"},\n    {\"text\": \"When she opened the door and saw the young man, she asked him to come into her house, sit at the fire and drink some hot soup she made for him.\", \"line\": 45, \"span\": \"When she opened the door and saw the young man, she asked him to come into her house, sit at the fire and drink some hot soup she made for him\"},\n    {\"text\": \"When the man recovered again, she gave him enough medicine made out of the herbs she collected in spring for the entire village.\", \"line\": 49, \"span\": \"When the man recovered again, she gave him enough medicine made out of the herbs she collected in spring for the entire village\"},\n    {\"text\": \"He traveled back to his village and went to the home of every sick person to provide them with the correct amount of medicine as told by the old lady from the woods.\", \"line\": 50, \"span\": \"He traveled back to his village and went to the home of every sick person to provide them with the correct amount of medicine as told by the old lady from the woods\"},\n    {\"text\": \"Eventually, everyone got healthy again.\", \"line\": 51, \"span\": \"Eventually, everyone got healthy again\"},\n    {\"text\": \"From then on the villagers sent a huge basket of cheese and dried meat to the old lady every autumn so that she could feast in winter.\", \"line\": 51, \"span\": \"from then on the villagers sent a huge basket of cheese and dried meat to the old lady every autumn so that she could feast in winter\"}\n  ]\n}\n```","ttft_ms":15986,"type":"result","duration_ms":16022,"uuid":"e8d930b9-dabd-4dd9-b161-9569e55342eb","ttft_stream_ms":793,"time_to_request_ms":96,"first_content_frame_ms":793,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
